1
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:07,120
Master, where should we head next?

2
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:11,150
Let's see... We bought the ingredients
for the hot pot, right?

3
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:14,330
That just leaves toilet
paper and shampoo...

4
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,090
Huh...

5
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,930
I guess you get one of these
when you get popular.

6
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,470
Must be nice... Getting your own figure.

7
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:29,070
Let's contact the manufacturer.

8
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:32,200
Nah... You're not supposed to
ask them to make one yourself.

9
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,100
Let's go.

10
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:34,960
Yes, sir!

11
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,650
Where should we go, Master?

12
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:40,280
What the heck is that?!

13
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:46,290
I loved reptiles so much
that I turned into one.

14
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:49,180
I'm Tongue-Stretcher!

15
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,980
Run away!

16
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:54,050
I'm not letting any of you girls get away!

17
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,800
You're mine! Yummy!

18
00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:59,250
Licky, licky, licky!

19
00:01:04,510 --> 00:01:06,050
Jeez, that startled me!

20
00:01:08,910 --> 00:01:10,390
Th-This vibe...

21
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,390
That face!

22
00:01:15,070 --> 00:01:17,900
H-He's no ordinary guy!

23
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:21,480
Man... I want to quit being a hero.

24
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,900
That guy's the strongest hero in the world!

25
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:25,950
It's King!

26
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:29,030
I knew I saw you somewhere!
You're the legendary...

27
00:01:29,030 --> 00:01:30,660
He'll stomp you in a single blow!

28
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:31,790
Can I have your autograph?

29
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:33,460
King! King!

30
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:39,960
King! King! King! King! King! King! King!

31
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:43,170
I-I-I'm terribly sorry for what I've done!

32
00:01:43,170 --> 00:01:44,550
Three cheers for King!

33
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,160
You pervert!

34
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,260
You're the worst.

35
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:49,090
Take care of him, Mr. King!

36
00:01:49,090 --> 00:01:51,010
How did it come to this?

37
00:01:49,090 --> 00:01:51,010
King! King! King! King!

38
00:01:51,010 --> 00:01:53,180
He's starting to have a seizure
while he's groveling!

39
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:54,510
You're so awesome, King.

40
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:57,250
Did you show up because you
sensed the monster, King?

41
00:01:57,250 --> 00:01:59,060
No, I was about to go shopp—

42
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:02,760
Hey, you can't just talk
to King like that.

43
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,150
Er, I don't really mind.

44
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:05,400
Could I just get a handshake?

45
00:02:06,330 --> 00:02:07,980
I'm busy.

46
00:02:08,510 --> 00:02:10,160
Would you mind leaving me alone?

47
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:11,800
W-We're terribly sorry!

48
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,720
Let's go! Let's go!

49
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:18,320
Thank you very much.

50
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:20,900
I was able to buy it.

51
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,550
The first-press limited edition
of Heartthrob Sisters 2.

52
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:26,030
I can never get enough of the excitement

53
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,510
I feel as I walk home
after buying a new game.

54
00:02:29,370 --> 00:02:31,480
I can't wait to get home and play.

55
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,680
Master, I believe that
gentleman is King after all.

56
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:39,150
Who?

57
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:41,860
He was one of the heroes
at the Class S gathering.

58
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:45,570
The first sequel in three
and a half years...

59
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,700
I'm feeling the hype!

60
00:02:53,490 --> 00:02:54,450
King.

61
00:02:54,950 --> 00:02:59,370
That man somehow claims your place
as the strongest man in the world.

62
00:02:59,790 --> 00:03:01,090
Ah...

63
00:03:01,090 --> 00:03:04,280
But what in the world is he doing here?

64
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,650
A-A monster!

65
00:03:08,340 --> 00:03:09,780
A monster?

66
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:11,390
Master, we should hurry!

67
00:03:11,390 --> 00:03:12,630
No, wait...

68
00:03:13,510 --> 00:03:16,620
This might be a good opportunity
to see King's true power.

69
00:03:17,180 --> 00:03:18,520
Let's see how things go.

70
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:25,770
I am G4! A machine god that
the organization created.

71
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:28,810
You're the Class S hero King, aren't you?

72
00:03:28,810 --> 00:03:30,490
I will eliminate you.

73
00:03:30,490 --> 00:03:32,820
Look! It's King! King's right over there!

74
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:35,520
You're aware that I'm King...

75
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:38,860
A Class S Rank 7 hero,
and the strongest man on Earth?

76
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:45,340
I'm saying that I've come to kill you!

77
00:03:50,470 --> 00:03:51,600
What the heck's that noise?

78
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,220
You've never heard of the King Engine?

79
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:57,000
It's the sound you hear once
King's in combat mode!

80
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,520
It's said that there's been no monster that
made it out alive after hearing that sound!

81
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:04,920
Listen well. This is also
a test of my combat AI.

82
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,480
I need you to fight at full
strength so I can gather data.

83
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:10,070
Is this thing a robot?

84
00:04:10,070 --> 00:04:12,400
What the hell is this organization?

85
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,740
I have no idea what it's talking about.

86
00:04:14,470 --> 00:04:18,290
All right, but let me go
to the bathroom first.

87
00:04:18,630 --> 00:04:22,750
I'll only be able to fight at about
half-strength if I'm holding it in.

88
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:25,670
That won't give you accurate data, will it?

89
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:28,550
I shall wait here for ten minutes.

90
00:04:29,550 --> 00:04:32,510
For every minute that you're late,
I shall kill ten people.

91
00:04:32,910 --> 00:04:33,720
Got it?

92
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,620
That monster seems pretty strong.

93
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:42,060
That thing is a robot... and quite powerful.

94
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,860
It's performance might be
higher than mine.

95
00:04:45,410 --> 00:04:49,020
I estimate that it's at least threat level
Demon and will be quite troublesome.

96
00:04:49,530 --> 00:04:53,290
I wonder how King will fight it.

97
00:04:53,990 --> 00:04:56,620
It came to kill me?

98
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:01,120
How did things end up like this?!

99
00:05:02,970 --> 00:05:05,280
I'm scared... I'm so scared!

100
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:07,410
I'm not strong!

101
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:10,880
I'm a 29-year-old unemployed
otaku and antisocial loser!

102
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:13,250
What the hell is the "King Engine"?!

103
00:05:13,250 --> 00:05:14,200
Are they stupid?!

104
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:17,890
I'm just twice, no, dozens of times
more cowardly than other people!

105
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:22,120
An evil monster just happened
to appear in front of me once

106
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:25,220
and someone defeated it
while I had my eyes closed.

107
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:29,650
That coincidentally happened
over and over again!

108
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:31,690
That's all it is!

109
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:36,030
But then the Hero Association
sent me a Class S certificate,

110
00:05:36,030 --> 00:05:38,870
saying that I was the ultimate rookie.

111
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:42,240
I mean, it's also my fault
because I didn't deny it,

112
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,740
but I never thought it'd come to this!

113
00:05:48,210 --> 00:05:51,360
Aw, man... I want to quit
being a hero so bad.

114
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:56,010
It's starting!

115
00:05:57,990 --> 00:06:01,140
Think! Think about how to get through this!

116
00:06:01,890 --> 00:06:03,580
I can't!

117
00:06:03,580 --> 00:06:06,670
It's not like my name's
gonna intimidate a robot!

118
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:11,020
I'm sorry!

119
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:13,230
I'm so sorry!

120
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:18,450
Someone's fighting it?

121
00:06:18,450 --> 00:06:19,870
I'm saved!

122
00:06:35,790 --> 00:06:37,590
What is that? A rocket punch?

123
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:45,120
Genos, want me to lend you a hand?

124
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:45,960
No.

125
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:48,100
In order for me to achieve your

126
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:51,430
assignment to me and rank
in the top ten of Class S,

127
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:53,350
I need to be able to

128
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:56,860
defeat something like this on my own!

129
00:06:57,340 --> 00:06:58,150
I see.

130
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,360
Well, see ya. Make sure you don't lose.

131
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,080
Emergency evacuation warning.

132
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:06,200
A robotic weapon is rampaging
near Central Park in City M.

133
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,710
Residents of the area should
immediately evacuate.

134
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,900
I somehow made it home safely, but...

135
00:07:15,410 --> 00:07:19,340
That scary robot is probably
going to haunt my dreams.

136
00:07:21,050 --> 00:07:23,450
I'll just play some games
and try to forget about it.

137
00:07:29,290 --> 00:07:33,230
They put so much work into the openings
of the Heartthrob Sisters series.

138
00:07:33,230 --> 00:07:35,360
I can barely contain my excitement.

139
00:07:35,850 --> 00:07:37,860
Input your name, Big Brother!

140
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:40,150
My name, huh?

141
00:07:40,150 --> 00:07:42,490
It'd be too embarrassing
to use my actual name.

142
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:44,530
I wonder what I should use.

143
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,530
Why not just use King?

144
00:07:46,530 --> 00:07:48,610
Yeah, I'm not sure about using my hero name.

145
00:07:48,610 --> 00:07:51,370
I mean, having someone call me
"Big Brother King" is just...

146
00:07:52,290 --> 00:07:53,160
Huh?

147
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,540
Um... What? Who the hell is this guy?

148
00:07:58,540 --> 00:07:59,340
What are they doing here?

149
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:01,760
Your window was open.

150
00:08:02,350 --> 00:08:04,720
We're on the 22nd floor.

151
00:08:07,930 --> 00:08:10,010
C-Come on, man.

152
00:08:10,010 --> 00:08:12,770
You can't just come in here uninvited!

153
00:08:14,890 --> 00:08:15,730
Ahem.

154
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:19,940
D-Do you know that I'm a Class S hero?

155
00:08:19,940 --> 00:08:22,200
Of course, I do. You're King, right?

156
00:08:22,990 --> 00:08:27,460
Th-This guy is the Class B hero that was at
the Class S hero meeting for some reason!

157
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:28,350
Could I get some tea?

158
00:08:29,460 --> 00:08:33,350
I had no idea you were interested
in games like this, though.

159
00:08:33,350 --> 00:08:35,380
Input your name, Big Brother!

160
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:40,550
Stop!

161
00:08:36,530 --> 00:08:38,660
Hey, what game is this?

162
00:08:39,090 --> 00:08:40,640
It looks fun.

163
00:08:41,260 --> 00:08:43,610
Oh, that's an action game.

164
00:08:43,610 --> 00:08:44,970
You operate a robot and stuff?

165
00:08:44,970 --> 00:08:45,720
Yeah, exactly!

166
00:08:46,050 --> 00:08:46,840
I see.

167
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,260
That's the kind of game I'm really into!

168
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:51,890
I bought this thinking it was an action game,
but what the heck? It's a dating sim!

169
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:53,520
I guess I bought it by mistake!

170
00:08:53,710 --> 00:08:55,810
It totally says Heartthrob Sisters.

171
00:08:55,810 --> 00:08:58,240
Seriously?! I totally thought
it said "Wrathful Shooters"!

172
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,880
Damn, they tricked me! I'll throw it away!

173
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,110
Then let's play this one.

174
00:09:01,110 --> 00:09:04,180
Yeah! That's a great idea!
That one's... Er, wait...

175
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:05,860
You wanna play that?

176
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:08,370
What? I can't? I mean,
you've got time, right?

177
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:10,320
Who the hell is this guy?

178
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:13,630
He's only a Class B, but he's super
pushy and way too casual with me.

179
00:09:13,630 --> 00:09:15,570
Not to mention, I'm older here!

180
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,630
Incinerate!

181
00:09:30,050 --> 00:09:31,970
I've melted your internal structures.

182
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:35,310
Your big body brought upon your downfall.

183
00:09:44,710 --> 00:09:47,570
The pilot? No... Its true form?

184
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:48,750
Not good!

185
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:54,790
Whoa, King. You're super
good at video games.

186
00:09:54,790 --> 00:09:59,510
I mean... I've won a few tournaments
for some fighting games, but...

187
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:00,920
Really?

188
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:04,420
So not only are you strong in real life,
you're a winner in video games, too?

189
00:10:04,420 --> 00:10:06,720
How long does he plan on being here?

190
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,610
Hurry up and—

191
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:09,680
So, why did you run away earlier?

192
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:13,970
Right now, Genos is fighting in your place.

193
00:10:13,970 --> 00:10:16,440
You're a super strong Class S hero, right?

194
00:10:17,030 --> 00:10:19,900
Why did you run away from
the robot monster then?

195
00:10:20,490 --> 00:10:24,570
I came here to ask you that,
but you were playing video games.

196
00:10:25,830 --> 00:10:28,320
Did you get bored with the monster?

197
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:32,530
Could it be that you're so strong that
you don't want to fight anymore?

198
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:35,000
Please, tell me.

199
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,670
Emergency evacuation warning.

200
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:41,220
A giant bird has appeared above City M.

201
00:10:41,220 --> 00:10:43,000
Threat level Demon.

202
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,990
Please do not go outside.

203
00:10:43,810 --> 00:10:44,990
Here we go again.

204
00:10:44,990 --> 00:10:46,460
I repeat...

205
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:48,430
That's the third warning just today.

206
00:10:48,710 --> 00:10:51,510
What are you going to do? I'm gonna go.

207
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,270
Well, I'll be damned.

208
00:10:59,270 --> 00:11:02,590
Guess the threat decided
to come right to you.

209
00:11:02,590 --> 00:11:06,790
Maybe there's something about
you that attracts monsters.

210
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:11,870
Yeah... I've always been super unlucky.

211
00:11:11,870 --> 00:11:13,410
What do you do in situations like this?

212
00:11:13,410 --> 00:11:15,660
But lately, it's been getting worse.

213
00:11:15,660 --> 00:11:19,710
I mean, if these things are showing up at
your house, you have to fight, don't you?

214
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:28,170
Damn it... I have to do
something about these lasers!

215
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:34,100
Come down.

216
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:39,230
My only target is King. I have
no time to waste on you.

217
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:43,560
Come on, God, give me a break!

218
00:11:44,230 --> 00:11:46,360
That one time, then that other time,

219
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,530
and then that other time!

220
00:11:48,970 --> 00:11:51,490
I just got dragged into those messes!

221
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:55,030
I'm always running away.

222
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,440
Eventually, someone'll
show up to defeat them.

223
00:11:59,050 --> 00:12:01,460
I just happened to be at those places,

224
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:04,370
but everyone ends up thinking I'm
the one who defeated those things!

225
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:08,010
I've never even been in a fight!

226
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:10,340
King...

227
00:12:10,340 --> 00:12:14,690
I ended up with this hero name because
they thought I was the ultimate hero

228
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:16,760
and my overwhelming strength...

229
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:18,540
What a joke.

230
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:21,480
I'm basically nothing but lies.

231
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,900
Oh?

232
00:12:36,430 --> 00:12:37,030
That's—

233
00:12:43,730 --> 00:12:45,220
Why you little...

234
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:49,140
The steam is—

235
00:12:50,370 --> 00:12:52,380
It appears that you're after King,

236
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:56,620
but I know someone that's stronger.

237
00:12:59,170 --> 00:13:01,100
You not gonna fight, King?

238
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:02,740
You've got the wrong idea!

239
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:05,400
I'm not the King that society
looks up to so much!

240
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:08,790
I have to say it! I have to say it!

241
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:10,920
If I don't say it now, he's—

242
00:13:11,470 --> 00:13:13,360
I'm actually—

243
00:13:23,500 --> 00:13:29,560
Seriously? So your strength and
battle history are all lies?

244
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:34,930
I guess it must be true if you
pissed your pants over that bird.

245
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,320
Wait, why are you just standing there?
What happened to the bird?

246
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:40,430
He... What?

247
00:13:40,750 --> 00:13:41,640
You okay?

248
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,310
Someone! Someone!

249
00:13:51,570 --> 00:13:55,200
Hey, calm down. I defeated the monster.

250
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:57,500
Is your eye okay?

251
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,810
Try opening it slowly.

252
00:14:01,420 --> 00:14:02,470
Can you see?

253
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:06,210
Wh-Who are you?

254
00:14:06,830 --> 00:14:07,700
Me?

255
00:14:08,060 --> 00:14:09,960
Hm...

256
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:12,380
I guess I'm just a guy who's
aspiring to be a hero for fun.

257
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:15,100
You're so hurt...

258
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:17,110
This is nothing.

259
00:14:17,890 --> 00:14:19,950
Today was a great victory.

260
00:14:24,370 --> 00:14:26,200
This guy is...

261
00:14:30,450 --> 00:14:31,920
Hey, what's the matter? Hey!

262
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,610
I'm so sorry!

263
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:39,950
Are you having fun?

264
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,570
Being a hero who lies and cowers in fear?

265
00:14:44,070 --> 00:14:45,420
No...

266
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:50,150
I mean, it's none of my business, so I'm
not going to lecture you or anything.

267
00:14:50,540 --> 00:14:55,810
But, uh... I may have been taking
credit for your deeds.

268
00:14:55,810 --> 00:14:58,220
This isn't about that.

269
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:01,320
You're everyone's hero.

270
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,680
No, I'm...

271
00:15:03,060 --> 00:15:07,680
No matter what you think, they think
that you're the ultimate hero.

272
00:15:08,690 --> 00:15:12,050
King, are you going to
continue with your lies?

273
00:15:12,050 --> 00:15:13,320
Or are you going to quit being a hero?

274
00:15:13,710 --> 00:15:16,140
I'm not sure...

275
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,250
In that case,

276
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:19,060
why don't you just get strong?

277
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:19,530
Huh?

278
00:15:20,050 --> 00:15:21,410
I'm going now.

279
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:22,490
See ya.

280
00:15:22,490 --> 00:15:24,210
Wait!

281
00:15:24,700 --> 00:15:26,260
Aren't you angry with me?

282
00:15:26,730 --> 00:15:30,710
You worked so hard to become
a hero, and yet, I...

283
00:15:31,550 --> 00:15:33,720
I'll be coming by now and
then to play some games.

284
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,000
Peace.

285
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:36,410
Oh!

286
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,380
Uh...

287
00:15:41,410 --> 00:15:42,470
Sure.

288
00:15:44,250 --> 00:15:48,600
Dr. Kuseno, these are parts from a
robot calling itself the Robot God G4.

289
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:52,710
It had immense power and superb AI.

290
00:15:53,210 --> 00:15:56,360
If there are any parts from it that
I can use, please allow me to do so.

291
00:15:56,630 --> 00:16:00,980
Th-This is... Genos, where did you get this?

292
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:02,470
Doctor,

293
00:16:03,090 --> 00:16:04,780
I want to get stronger.

294
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:08,290
All right. Let's give it a try.

295
00:16:08,670 --> 00:16:11,740
I believe I can still make you stronger.

296
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:12,920
Thank you.

297
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:18,490
But, Genos, while I know you became a
cyborg for the sake of justice,

298
00:16:18,490 --> 00:16:20,520
you shouldn't push yourself too hard.

299
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:23,090
No, I have to push myself.

300
00:16:23,810 --> 00:16:27,310
Right now, I'm trying to rank
in the top ten of Class S.

301
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:31,610
That reckless assignment
your master assigned you?

302
00:16:32,050 --> 00:16:34,190
I figured you'd say that.

303
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:40,740
More importantly, Genos, have you
gathered any clues about the cyborg?

304
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:43,780
That rampaging cyborg
that destroyed your home?

305
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:48,730
You seem to be completely focused
on your hero activities lately.

306
00:16:49,230 --> 00:16:51,960
I haven't been able to track it down at all.

307
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:55,440
I see... But—

308
00:16:55,440 --> 00:17:00,510
The rampaging cyborg that's destroyed
many towns and taken countless lives...

309
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,380
I will track it down, no matter what,

310
00:17:03,830 --> 00:17:06,260
and destroy it with my own hands.

311
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:08,850
No matter what. Whatever it takes.

312
00:17:09,430 --> 00:17:12,240
Despite becoming a hero
and gaining a master,

313
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:14,560
it appears that his hatred
hasn't disappeared.

314
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:18,860
Genos, I'm worried.

315
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:22,220
I've been pursuing this
cyborg longer than you,

316
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:25,660
and I know just how dangerous it is.

317
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:32,080
If you do end up finding it, don't do
anything rash and report back to me.

318
00:17:32,690 --> 00:17:38,860
You are calm and intelligent,
but your youth can invite disaster.

319
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:41,000
Do not fight it alone.

320
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:44,130
Doctor Kuseno, I understand.

321
00:17:44,990 --> 00:17:47,310
This is our fight.

322
00:17:49,430 --> 00:17:56,970
I am Sitch, the leader of Earth in the Danger
Prophecy Emergency Countermeasures Team.

323
00:17:56,970 --> 00:17:59,600
I am deeply grateful that denizens

324
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:03,320
of the underworld like yourselves
would heed our call.

325
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:05,510
Let me just say

326
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:09,870
that we will not be looking into your
criminal history or activities at this time.

327
00:18:10,470 --> 00:18:12,480
This is not a trap.

328
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:15,540
There are a few heroes here, but they
are just serving as my bodyguards.

329
00:18:15,540 --> 00:18:17,200
Heroes?

330
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:19,930
Bring them on! I'll murder all of them!

331
00:18:19,930 --> 00:18:24,020
They won't act as long as you
don't do anything reckless.

332
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:26,800
Why don't we just take over the place?

333
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:31,580
Wanted men with huge
bounties and top assassins.

334
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:33,150
Even prison escapees.

335
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:38,150
What is Sitch thinking,
inviting these ruffians here?

336
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:41,750
I don't know why he brought them here,

337
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:44,900
but the nerve these criminals
had to actually show up...

338
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:48,860
I'll burn them to cinders if they make
even the slightest suspicious move.

339
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:54,550
Three upper-rank Class A heroes,
whose fighting power is close to Class S.

340
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:58,440
No one here is stupid enough to
lose control in front of them.

341
00:18:58,440 --> 00:19:00,960
All right, let's begin.

342
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,630
Wait.

343
00:19:02,690 --> 00:19:05,250
Where's the hero named Saitama?

344
00:19:05,250 --> 00:19:07,380
Doesn't he live in these headquarters?

345
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:10,050
Who are you?

346
00:19:10,780 --> 00:19:14,380
I'd appreciate it if we could hold off
on anything off topic until later.

347
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:15,680
This is rather important.

348
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:18,690
He isn't here? Then I'm leaving.

349
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:21,310
You're going to leave without
hearing what he has to say?

350
00:19:21,730 --> 00:19:23,940
I won't let that happen,
now that you're here.

351
00:19:24,510 --> 00:19:28,660
Level Tiger or higher disasters
are happening more often lately.

352
00:19:28,660 --> 00:19:32,200
This month, the rate is six times
the last three years' average.

353
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:38,400
Are these omens of the danger
foretold by the great Shibabwa,

354
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,830
or has it already begun?

355
00:19:41,330 --> 00:19:43,140
If this continues,

356
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:45,630
the current heroes will be exhausted
and unable to deal with the disasters.

357
00:19:46,190 --> 00:19:51,180
The prophecy said the greatest
disaster in history will occur

358
00:19:51,180 --> 00:19:54,510
within six months, and clearly,
it hasn't passed.

359
00:19:54,870 --> 00:19:58,170
Even Class S heroes are dealing
with some of these incidents,

360
00:19:58,170 --> 00:20:02,310
but there are so many disasters happening,
there aren't enough heroes to go around.

361
00:20:03,770 --> 00:20:09,070
In other words, in the increasingly intense
fights to save humanity that lie ahead

362
00:20:09,070 --> 00:20:13,410
you want help from both the good and bad,

363
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:16,120
as long as they know how to fight.

364
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:18,620
Does that pretty much sum it up?

365
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:21,290
Well, I still refuse.

366
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:25,790
H-How did he get his hands on
papers I never even  handed out?

367
00:20:26,330 --> 00:20:29,420
The thought of playing hero with you losers

368
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:32,430
nauseates me.

369
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:39,020
Damn it. What a waste of time.

370
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:43,350
This was a great opportunity for outsiders
to enter the Hero Association HQ,

371
00:20:43,350 --> 00:20:48,360
but all I know about him are his name,
his face, and that he's Class B Rank 33.

372
00:20:49,290 --> 00:20:51,070
Seriously? A guy like him?

373
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,570
Unbelievable.

374
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:54,870
Yes.

375
00:20:55,290 --> 00:20:58,530
In the physical exam
portion of the Hero Test,

376
00:20:58,530 --> 00:21:01,000
he crushed every record for every event.

377
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:01,980
Lady Blizzard!

378
00:21:02,740 --> 00:21:06,130
Despite having no notable record
of his actions since then,

379
00:21:06,630 --> 00:21:09,180
he managed to climb up
from Class C to Class B.

380
00:21:09,180 --> 00:21:10,800
Right after his debut, on top of that.

381
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,510
There has to be something about this man.

382
00:21:14,220 --> 00:21:16,220
There has to be something about him.

383
00:21:16,850 --> 00:21:18,680
A secret behind his strength.

384
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:23,950
First, we're going to find out where he is.

385
00:21:23,950 --> 00:21:24,850
Yes, ma'am!

386
00:21:25,800 --> 00:21:28,940
I'm going to hunt him down,
and I'm going to make him regret

387
00:21:28,940 --> 00:21:32,950
the fact that he managed to embarrass
me, Sound-o'-Speed Sonic.

388
00:21:32,950 --> 00:21:35,070
Just you wait...

389
00:21:35,600 --> 00:21:37,340
You better be prepared...

390
00:21:37,910 --> 00:21:39,260
...Saitama!

391
00:21:43,120 --> 00:21:45,600
Hey, why are you taking all the items?

392
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:46,860
What the hell, man?

393
00:21:46,860 --> 00:21:48,440
First come, first serve.

394
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:51,140
This is co-op, you moron.
You friggin' moron, King.

395
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:53,080
I'm still in my default gear!

396
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:55,300
Don't worry. I can beat them by myself.

397
00:21:57,310 --> 00:21:59,530
Whoops. The controller broke.

398
00:21:59,530 --> 00:22:00,440
Huh?

399
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:37,110
There better be a reward for this.

400
00:23:38,100 --> 00:23:39,740
Hey, come on now.

401
00:23:40,210 --> 00:23:43,180
This great prophecy's pretty insane.
